To deal with reporting annotation (see CDI-471), CDI 2.0 introduced default method {{getAnnotations}} , in the following interfaces:

* {{AnnotatedConstructor}}
* {{AnnotatedField}}
* {{AnnotatedMethod}}
* {{AnnotatedParameter}}
* {{AnnotatedType}}

These methods make use of reflection and thus should use privileged blocs when used with a security manager

